    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n113744" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χελιχελώνη</span></b> , ἡ, a
		girls' game, in which a ring was formed round a player called <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χελώνη,</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Poll.
			9.125
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Eust.
			1914.54
		</span></i>. The <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χελι-</span> seems to be merely an
		iteration of the first syll. in <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χελώνη;</span>
		cf. <i><span class="en">
			<u>Carm.Pop.</u>
			21
		</span></i> (written <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χέλει χ.</span> Eust.l.c.).</div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
